  "plain": "A treasure hunter named Dennis Asberg says that in 2011, at the Baltic Sea anomaly, a strange object his team found on the floor of the Baltic Sea, they caught on film a triangle-shaped thing with a round hole in it. Asberg tells Michels this as something from his own expedition, describing it with his hands: \"like triangle like this... with a hole in it.\" He tells it among other odd events at the same site, as a sign that the object is more than an ordinary rock."
